{{~##
   What every generated C# file starts with: the banner, the usings, and the namespace.

   Shared because the output is a file per table now, and a header repeated in five
   templates is five places for one of them to lose the `auto-generated` block - which is
   what stops an analyser and a formatter from touching the file, and what the sweep
   recognises its own output by.

   The namespace is opened here and closed by csharp-file-foot.sbn. Indentation below it is
   literal and written for the nested case, which is the normal one; without a namespace the
   generator takes one level back off, because the printer this replaced got its indentation
   from a scope stack and a template cannot.
##~}}
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// <auto-generated>
//     THIS CODE WAS GENERATED BY Tabbit.
//
//     CHANGES TO THIS FILE MAY CAUSE INCORRECT BEHAVIOR AND WILL BE LOST IF
//     THE CODE IS REGENERATED.
// </auto-generated>
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
{{~ if usings | array.size > 0 ~}}

{{ include 'csharp-using.sbn' ~}}
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ if namespace != '' }}
namespace {{ namespace }}
{
{{~ end ~}}
